cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MicroView RC in a project, please cite this repository."
title: "MicroView RC"
type: software
version: "4.1.18"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Open-source DIY radio-control transmitter and receiver based on a SparkFun
  MicroView / ATmega328P transmitter, ATtiny85 supervisor and nRF24L01+ link,
  intended for drones, RC cars, boats, airplanes, robots, rovers and custom
  embedded remote-control projects.
keywords:
  - Arduino RC
  - Arduino remote control
  - DIY RC transmitter
  - DIY RC receiver
  - radio control
  - remote control
  - nRF24L01
  - RF24
  - ATmega328P
  - ATtiny85
  - SparkFun MicroView
  - RC telemetry
  - drone controller
  - quadcopter controller
  - RC car
  - RC boat
  - RC airplane
  - robot remote control
  - robotics
  - embedded systems
  - ESP32 RC adaptation
  - STM32 RC adaptation
  - RP2040 RC adaptation
  - Raspberry Pi Pico RC adaptation
